  "name": "28-apply-generalized-ih-fact",
  "description": "A full induction derivation over `apply` with a GENERALIZED inductive hypothesis (since 1.1): fact_aux x n = x*fact n, induction on n. The step unfolds fact_aux x (S n) to fact_aux (x*(S n)) n, then applies the IH at the SHIFTED accumulator x*(S n) - sound because cvc5 co-quantifies x (the induction var is quantified first so --quant-ind inducts on n). cvc5regate certifies each step against a just-proven rule and backstops the leap. The other backends decline per the Unimplemented-vocabulary rule: all three now parse and translate `apply`, but each declines this request for its own reason (all `unknown`): eggregate models only the exact P(n) IH, leanregate's derivation does not close syntactically without an AC/assoc step, coqregate has no generalized-IH matcher in its step_check clone. Pins C1 (apply) + C2 (generalized IH).",
